invention, the coupling arrangement 120 and coupling device 130 are initially provided together in the same location, in particular, they are attached to and/or supported by the body of the extraction assembly. This may be advantageous because it may provide a more compact extraction assembly, but it does not need to be the case. It could be that the coupling arrangement is provided in a different location to the coupling device. For example, the coupling device could be mounted to the aircraft 1, and the coupling device could cause the coupling to close when thecoupling arrangement passes the coupling device during extraction of the platform  SVG
